    "Description": "Copy of a letter from Larry E. Tise, State Historic Preservation Officer, to Mr. Frank Evans, Director of Parks and Recreation Department of the City of Raleigh, and Mrs. Rachael S. Farley, Chairman of Carousel Restoration for the Raleigh Fine Arts Society. The letter notifies them of the grant-in-aid awarded to them for $5,000, as well as administrative deadlines related to the grant. More details of the grant fund requirements are also outlined. Signed by Larry E. Tise and dated to March 10, 1978. Two pages total, stapled in the top left corner. ",
